      "id": 1,
      "title": "Add MFA to SSO scope",
      "description": "Extend the current SSO implementation to require multi-factor authentication (TOTP / push) for all privileged accounts before production go-live. Driven by updated InfoSec policy issued 2026-05-20.",
      "type": "Scope",
      "status": "Under Review",
      "impact": "High",
