      "id": 2,
      "title": "Extend go-live by two weeks",
      "description": "Proposed two-week slip of the production cutover (from 2026-09-01 to 2026-09-15) to accommodate the MFA scope addition and unresolved SSO provider SLA concerns. Allows a full regression cycle and a second hypercare rehearsal.",
